              "value": "Attach Line"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe animated kite gives its line to an adjacent ally with a free hand. The kite remains attached until the creature releases it or the kite flies more than 60 feet away. A creature between them can also sever the line with a successful Strike against AC 13 that deals any amount of slashing damage."
            },
